msgid "PAN-PAN, PAN-PAN. This is the sailing yacht %s, %s nm to the %s of you. We have %s and are drifting. No one is hurt. We ask a vessel nearby to stand by until the coastguard's boat arrives, about %d hours."
msgstr "PAN-PAN, PAN-PAN. Her er sejlbåden %s, %s sm %s for dig. Vi har %s og driver. Ingen er kommet til skade. Vi beder et fartøj i nærheden om at ligge standby, til kystvagtens båd når frem, om ca. %d timer."

msgid "Channel 16: the fishing boat %s, %s nm to the %s, asks if any vessel has the latest forecast for these waters."
msgstr "Kanal 16: fiskerbåden %s, %s sm mod %s, spørger, om nogen har den nyeste vejrudsigt for farvandet."

msgid "Answering means heaving to nearby for about %d hours: the voyage waits, the weather does not. Declining is fine: another vessel will answer."
msgstr "At svare betyder at ligge underdrejet i nærheden i ca. %d timer: sejladsen venter, vejret gør ikke. Det er fint at sige nej: et andet fartøj svarer."

msgid "A quick reply on the radio. Nothing else is asked of you."
msgstr "Et hurtigt svar på radioen. Mere bliver der ikke bedt om."

msgid "Little Captain's Hat"
msgstr "Little Captain's Hat"

